    "De cero a correr 5 km de corrido, alternando caminata y trote con progresión suave. Ritmos libres: la regla es poder hablar mientras trotás. Contenido provisional.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From zero to running 5 km continuously, alternating walking and jogging with a gentle progression. Open paces: the rule is being able to talk while you jog. Provisional content."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "De corrido, ritmo de charla.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
