    "Guarda FC, distancia y ruta en Salud. No uses Runna a la vez. Auto-pausa (requiere GPS): al frenar en un semáforo pausa todo y sigue sola. Las zonas se calculan solas con tu edad y tu FC en reposo de Salud.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saves heart rate, distance and route to Health. Don't use Runna at the same time. Auto-pause (needs GPS): when you stop at a traffic light it pauses everything and resumes on its own. Zones are calculated automatically from your age and your resting heart rate in Health."
          }
        }
      }
    },
